5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to stop guessing who uses this room. I want hard data on who is actually in there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The noise is the real problem. I can hear everything from my desk. We need to check the wall.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we spend money, we must understand the hidden costs. Who is paying for the upkeep?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am worried about the monthly fees. We need to see the invoices for outside hires.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I feel like we are strangers. I want to know where the awkward talks happen.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, the invoices might show if we are overpaying for space we barely use.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, the wall is just plasterboard. Sound travels easily. I will look into that.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the tally will show if a few people are hogging the space.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, if we know where the bad talks happen, we can fix the layout.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the wall is bad, maybe we need a quiet room option.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the tally of use. It seems unfair if only two people use it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the partition wall. It needs to be soundproofed or we need a different use.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will check the facilities callouts. If it breaks often, it is a waste of time.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the invoices. We need to know the true cost per hour.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check where the last awkward conversation happened. It matters for our morale.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let's look at the numbers.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The wall is critical.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Efficiency is key.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Paper trails are best.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's make this work for everyone.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
