35,2,1,talk,May,,The tally shows two people used it eleven times. The rest only four. It is unbalanced.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is thin. I can hear phone calls clearly. The unplanned talk is gone, only printer chats remain.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Eleven callouts last year. That is a lot of maintenance. The invoices show we paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The quotes are high. 141,000 for a meeting setup, 96,000 for a kitchen. The invoices confirm the high cost.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The last awkward talk was across the desks. It was public and painful. The lunch trip takes 25 minutes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that bad, a quiet room might not work unless we soundproof it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the crumbs are everywhere. Three keyboards have crumbs. The bins are full daily.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, 68,000 yen for nine bookings is expensive. We are paying for convenience we do not use well.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, the kitchen quote is cheaper, but the maintenance is a risk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, if we make it a meeting space, we can book it and avoid the awkwardness.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The crumbs suggest people are eating there. Maybe a kitchen is what we actually need?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"But the noise... if we eat, we talk. The wall lets it out.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A meeting space requires a screen and table. 141,000 yen. Is it worth it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The kitchen is 96,000. But who cleans it? The crumbs are already a problem.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,A meeting space gives us a place to talk properly. Not across desks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I am leaning towards a kitchen, but the mess is a concern.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I am worried about the noise. A quiet room is ideal, but the wall is bad.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,The meeting space seems most efficient for structured use.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,The costs are high either way. We need to be sure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I want a place to talk. A meeting space helps with that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
